     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "Black smokers on the sea floor blast out water as hot as four hundred sixty-four degrees Celsius.",
     "cap": "Up to *464 °C.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 0
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "It doesn't boil, because the pressure down there is crushing.",
