    }
   ],
   "vis": 1
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "The chimneys grow huge. One, called Godzilla, reached forty meters before it fell over in 1996.",
     "cap": "*Godzilla:* *40 m* tall."
    }
   ],
   "vis": 2
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "And there's life. Giant tube worms over two meters tall. No mouth. No gut. Bacteria feed them.",
     "cap": "Tube worms: *2+ m.* *No mouth.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 3
  },
  {
   "dur": 4,
   "vo": [
    {
     "at": 0.45,
     "text": "No sunlight at all. The whole food chain runs on chemicals.",
     "cap": "No sunlight. It runs on *chemicals.*"
    }
   ],
   "vis": 4
  },
  {
